The patch includes short version-specific matching strings required to locate
the supported program behavior. Complete vendor source files and binaries are
read only from the user's own local installation and kept in local build output.

The ASAR integrity dictionary encoding and sentinel are documented in Electron:
https://github.com/electron/electron/blob/main/shell/common/asar/integrity_digest.mm
